        },
        {
          "text": " Ra Urimu ne Tumimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Urimu ne Tumimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "bibiindu bibili bibiarumikhwangwa ne omusaayi khumanya lilienya lia Wele. Se limanyikhaane bung'ali nga ne biarumikhwanga tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu silaka sie mu sifuba. Aruni acha khubisuta amwoyo kwewe ne alikho ne acha ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Nono Aruni akhasute bukhalaki bwe babaandu ba Isiraeli a mwoyo kwewe ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi buli lwosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chingubo chichiindi che Busaayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Engubo endeeyi mukari mwa efodi ebe eye buusi bubuusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekhoya yaaba ne kumwanya kwe kumurwe. Kumwanya kuno kukhoyeele kubotookhelesibwe ne buusi nio efodi ekhatabukha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu likemo lie engubo eyo kholakho bifwaani bie kamatuunda kamakomanga ke buusi bubuusi, bunapeenda ne bubesemu kalibotookhelesie. Ne chikengele che esahabu chibe akari we bifwaani bie kamatuunda kamakomanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli e keengele eye esahabu ekhoya eloondekhane ne sifwaani sie lituunda likomanga. Khola murio khubotookhelesia likemo lioosi lie engubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruni akhoya efware engubo eyo ne akhola kimilimo. Chikengele chayo chipe chiuliilikhane ne alikho ne engila Abuundu Atakatifu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne lundi ne arurao nio akhafwa tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khola limili lie esahabu yong'ene mala oandikekho nga kumuuri oli ‘Endakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ochwiisilie limili elio khu sileemba khulwe khurumikhira kumukoye kwe buusi bubuusi. Limili elio libe sileemba ebweeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruni efwaare limili elio mala ebukulile kamabi kosi kosi kanyoolekhwa mu siianwa sitakatifu nisio Baisiraeli baleera nga biianwa biabwe bitakatifu. Limili elio libe khumurwe kwa Aruni nio biianwa ebio bifukiililwe ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Engubo eye lukoondo lulwaukhaane ebe engubo eya katani endayi, ne sileemba siosi sibe sie engubo eya katani endayi ne kakhali naba kumusiipi kwe buusi mu busicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nabila ba okhwa Aruni chikaanjo, chikhoba ne chikuutwa. Bibiindu ebio bikholwe khubaelesia luyali ne lukoondo lulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ofwaare Aruni wandaayo ne basoleeli bewe bibiindu bino mala obachukhekho kamafura, obarekho kamakhono, obaaule nio bakholele ese nga basaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banabile chisirwari cha katani khulwe khubiimba siichula siabwe. Naba chisirwari chichama mu sibuno khukhwola khu maraango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruni ne basoleeli bewe befwaare chisirwari chino ne bengila mu liiema lie kumuse namwe ne bacha siimbi ne alutare khukhola kimilimo Abuundu Atakatifu. Bakhola bario nio bakhereerera bumayaanu mala bafwe tawe. Elino liliba lilaka lia mindali khu Aruni ne lisaaye liewe enyuma wewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
